+## Offscreen rerun
+
+The same Release audit also completed without a desktop display server:
+
+```text
+SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen SDL_GPU_DRIVER=vulkan DOTNET_ROOT=/opt/dotnet-10 \
+  DOTNET_ROOT_X64=/opt/dotnet-10 timeout 90 \
+  /opt/dotnet-10/dotnet src/lancer/bin/Release/net10.0/lancer.dll \
+  --sdl-gpu-production-pipeline-audit
+Installed Vulkan doesn't implement the VK_EXT_headless_surface extension
+SDL_GPU production pipeline audit driver: vulkan
+SDL_GPU production pipeline audit passed: 26 bundles, 3495 pipelines created and released.
+```
+
+The SDL warning and incomplete Haswell driver still apply. This command creates
+and releases pipelines only; it does not need a swapchain and does not prove
+offscreen scene rendering or pixel output.
